Let plugin rows, columns, boxes and images take onRightClick, like buttons.

Only ui.button had onRightClick, and a button can't hold other controls, so a
plugin had no way to react to a right-click on a composite element. The click
wrapper that onClick and onHover already put around rows, columns, boxes and
images now also takes onRightClick: it accepts the right button and runs that
callback for it, and either click callback can be set without the other.

